Build fedora image for rpi4b, rpi5, opi5, rockpi4b and rk3328:

Input files: ../kernel/linux-${CHIP}/tmp/boot/*
             ../kernel/linux-${CHIP}/tmp/lib/modules/*

cd ~/build-5sbc/fedora

make setup_host
make clean
make CHIP=rpi4b build_image
The result is in ./build/fedora4sbc.raw.raw

CHIP=rpi4b ./mk-espimage.sh
The result is in ./fedora-esp.img

Plugin NVMe SSD to PC.  ( rpi4b, rpi5 and roc-rk3328-cc use usb3 stick )
sudo CHIP=rpi4b ./mksdcardimg.sh

Plugin NVMe SSD to sbc.  ( rpi4b, rpi5 and roc-rk3328-cc use usb3 stick )
Setup wifi host username userpasswd locales
Disable power saving, auto suspend and screen saver.
sudo dnf install net-tools openssh-server pulseaudio-utils
sudo systemctl start sshd.service
sudo systemctl enable sshd.service

ssh-keygen -R 192.168.86.22
ssh linaro@192.168.86.22
df .
uname -a
sudo dnf update

speedtest-cli
glmark2-es2-wayland
aplay -l
pavucontrol  ( select hdmi as default sound )

firefox -> youtube.com -> search YmDNhi07_Ho

sudo systemctl start vsftpd
sudo systemctl enable vsftpd

Do follows on PC, then ftp swan.mp4 to sbc.
(
git clone https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp.git
cd yt-dlp
make
cd ../
(rk3328) ~/yt-dlp/yt-dlp -f 'bestvideo[ext=mp4]+bestaudio[ext=m4a]' 3qrKjywjo7Q -o "temp_%(id)s.%(ext)s" --exec "ffmpeg -y -i {} -vf scale=1024:640 -r 10 -b:v 2M -c:a copy swan.mp4 && rm {}"
(opi5,rpi5,rockpi4b,rpi4b) ~/yt-dlp/yt-dlp -f 'bestvideo[ext=mp4]+bestaudio[ext=m4a]' 3qrKjywjo7Q -o swan.mp4
)

mpv swan.mp4
ffplay -autoexit swan.mp4
cvlc swan.mp4

Except rockpi4b, plugin ASUS BT500 bluetooth usb dongle to sbc.
sudo rfkill list
bluetoothctl -> scan on -> scan off -> exit
